      "item": "tribalpower:rite_spring_calling",
      "text": [
        "The smallest tablet rite, and where a camp's water comes from. Spring Calling turns a Spirit Cistern beside the brazier into a spring: **100 mB a second for ten minutes**."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Calling a spring",
      "text": [
        "Draw the [Rite Circle](rite_circle). Seat the **Water Seal** in the brazier and place a **Spirit Cistern** touching it.",
        "Crouch and use the tablet on the brazier. It draws **300 Pulse** from the Lattice within 8 blocks, and the cistern starts filling. You do not have to stand beside it.",
        "No circle, no cistern, or too little Pulse: the rite names the problem and nothing is spent."
      ]
    },
